        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Johnston, Daryl Palumbo\n- Places: Elmira, New York, Long Island, New York\n- Music Works: China Grove\n- Bands: Head Automatica, Glassjaw\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Johnston was born on August 15, 1948, and he is an American musician.\n- Daryl Palumbo was born on February 10, 1979, and he is an American musician originally from Elmira, New York.\n- Tom Johnston was the original main singer-songwriter who wrote and sang the song \"China Grove.\"\n- Head Automatica is an American rock band from Long Island, New York, and Daryl Palumbo fronts the band.\n- Daryl Palumbo is also associated with the band Glassjaw.",
